# Binary files: never convert line endings or diff as text. Without this, git guessed per file, and a PDF with no NUL byte
# early on was stored as text (2026-11-09, client/public/cost-per-reportable-test-framework.pdf); with core.autocrlf on, a
# Windows checkout would add carriage returns and corrupt it.
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
